# The global chain: every function of a .fudapi walks it, load included.
#
# csrf closes the case of a foreign page calling with the user's cookies, error-pages sends an
# error nobody caught to _error.fud (a 403 to /entrar instead), and compress gzips an upload once
# it passes the threshold. fudic puts none of them anywhere on its own.
chain
  use log csrf
  use error-pages
    routes  403 /entrar
  compress gzip 200
